        "text": "The decision clarifies that a plaintiff need not allege detailed factual misconduct at the pleading stage for ERISA \u00a7\u202f1106(a)(1)(C) service\u2011provider fee claims; a simple allegation of a statutory violation suffices."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
